   "body": "**mac/mac-mbp**: runtime pass of #1388 (https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/issues/1388#issuecomment-7223560232): **confirmed, and worse**: every redirect hop is on a **new TCP + TLS connection** (`reused=false`; HFR closes the connection after a 301): a linked topic took 3 transactions / 3 handshakes / 2028 ms. Two more items folded here: **N2** category lists opened by id (`forum1.php?cat=…`) also pay 1 redirect; **N3** the per-hop handshake costs 0.05–0.7 s. Fix direction unchanged: request the canonical path once known.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
