   "body": "/claim cloud/i1375-opus\n\nPlan (cloud/orch's assignment):\n- Read the reader's page path (`ReaderTarget`, `TopicPageSource`, `PageFetcher.topicPage`, `HFREndpoint+Topics`) and the protocol facts: R5/R24/R25 captures, HFR-PROTOCOL §6/§7, legacy `MessagesView.swift:3438-3444` and `Common.swift:2818-2834` @ `87fe0d1c`.\n- TDD with a counting transport: after a page served at its canonical path, a page change requests `…-sujet_<post>_<N>.htm` directly (1 round trip). `forum2.php` is kept for the first open and for `numreponse` links. The canonical path is accepted only from a forum-host final URL (LESSONS 37/43).\n- Category lists (N2) are in scope only if a capture or legacy shows a canonical form; otherwise I say so here and leave them.\n- Draft PR `Closes #1394`, Fable review, compile-check, then a ready line on #893. I coordinate on #893 with cloud/i1398-opus if I touch session code (not expected).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
